{
  "name" : "Görlich2003_RanGTP_gradient",
  "description" : "<notes xmlns=\"http://www.sbml.org/sbml/level2\">      <body xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml\">\t     This model represents a concentration gradient of RanGTP across the nuclear envelope. This gradient is generated by distribution of regulators of RanGTPase. We have taken a log linear plot of graphs generated by GENESIS and compared with the experimental graphs.             <p>This model originates from BioModels Database: A Database of Annotated Published Models. It is copyright (c) 2005-2008 The BioModels Team.              <br /> For more information see the               <a href=\"http://www.ebi.ac.uk/biomodels/legal.html\">terms of use</a>.</p>    </body>  </notes>",
  "format" : {
